   builds:["A real backend (.NET 8, clean architecture) that accepts a resume (PDF/docx), parses it, extracts stack + seniority + domains.","An LLM-backed generation step that produces briefs like these — structured, validated, calibrated to difficulty.","Persistence: users, projects, status, and the artifact links (repo/demo/write-up) behind each portfolio card.","The artifact gate enforced in code: a project can't reach the portfolio without its links.","Auth, deployed hosting, CI/CD — a real running product, not a demo."],
